  "config": {
    "title": "FondoBarrio",
    "details": "\"Juega por el Barrio\" (Play-to-Donate) platform — a community fundraising DApp with a water/community theme in Spanish. Features: (1) Cause/Community Fund Display showing active cause, goal (meta), total raised (totalRecaudado), progress bar with percentage, and stats (totalDonantes, totalPartidas, saldoContrato). (2) Direct Donations Module — wallet connect (MetaMask/Rabby), donation amount input in MON (18 decimals), calls donar() with value, shows tx confirmation and DonacionRecibida event. (3) Play-to-Donate Minigame — Canvas-based \"catch the falling water drops\" game, player moves basket with arrow keys/touch/mouse, win condition: catch 10 drops in 30 seconds, on win calls registrarPartida(), shows PartidaCompletada event, displays user's partidasPorJugador and total aporte liberado. (4) Transparent Disbursement Module — admin-only (visible only if connected wallet is representante), form with destination address, amount in MON, and concept string, calls desembolsar(destino, monto, concepto), shows FondosDesembolsados event. Design: modern, clean, community-oriented. Color palette: warm greens and blues (water/community theme). Spanish language throughout. Responsive layout. Header with \"Juega por el Barrio\" logo and wallet connect button. Main sections: Hero with cause info + progress, Donate card, Minigame card, Disbursement card (admin only), and a real-time events feed at the bottom listening to all 4 events (CausaActualizada, DonacionRecibida, FondosDesembolsados, PartidaCompletada). The minigame has start screen, play state, and win/lose states.",
    "description": "\"Juega por el Barrio\" (Play-to-Donate) platform — a community fundraising DApp with a water/community theme in Spanish. Features: (1) Cause/Community Fund Display showing active cause, goal (meta), total raised (totalRecaudado), progress bar with percentage, and stats (totalDonantes, totalPartidas, saldoContrato). (2) Direct Donations Module — wallet connect (MetaMask/Rabby), donation amount input in MON (18 decimals), calls donar() with value, shows tx confirmation and DonacionRecibida event. (3) Play-to-Donate Minigame — Canvas-based \"catch the falling water drops\" game, player moves basket with arrow keys/touch/mouse, win condition: catch 10 drops in 30 seconds, on win calls registrarPartida(), shows PartidaCompletada event, displays user's partidasPorJugador and total aporte liberado. (4) Transparent Disbursement Module — admin-only (visible only if connected wallet is representante), form with destination address, amount in MON, and concept string, calls desembolsar(destino, monto, concepto), shows FondosDesembolsados event. Design: modern, clean, community-oriented. Color palette: warm greens and blues (water/community theme). Spanish language throughout. Responsive layout. Header with \"Juega por el Barrio\" logo and wallet connect button. Main sections: Hero with cause info + progress, Donate card, Minigame card, Disbursement card (admin only), and a real-time events feed at the bottom listening to all 4 events (CausaActualizada, DonacionRecibida, FondosDesembolsados, PartidaCompletada). The minigame has start screen, play state, and win/lose states.",
